+## Xiaohongshu REST failure policy
+
+- HTTP 401: `credential_problem`, no retry and no key mutation.
+- HTTP 429: `rate_limited`, one bounded backoff without increasing concurrency.
+- Other 4xx: `request_error`, no retry.
+- 5xx / connection / timeout: `transient`, retry the identical request once.
+- HTTP success with a non-success provider code: `provider_error`.
+- Final errors include `layer=TikHub`, `platform=xiaohongshu`, `transport=rest`, and `status=unavailable`.
+- `can't start new thread` is MCP-specific and is not part of the REST handler.
